<title>USA: Elder-Beerman June same-store sales up 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Elder-Beerman June same-store sales up 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elder-Beerman Stores Corp said on Thursday that for the five-week period ended July 5, same-store sales were $45.5 million, a 3.0 percent increase from the same period last year.</p>
<p>The privately held company said total department store sales rose 1.7 percent from the prior year.</p>
